ng embellishments: the venue says 167 were restored.</span></span></li><li class=\"gh-docent__item\"><span class=\"gh-docent__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">02</span></span><span class=\"gh-docent__text\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The floor is original Carrara marble.</span></span></li><li class=\"gh-docent__item\"><span class=\"gh-docent__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">03</span></span><span class=\"gh-docent__text\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Three fireplaces date from the 19th century.</span></span></li></ol></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--alt\" aria-labelledby=\"features-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"What is in the room\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"features-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What is in the room</span></h2></div><div class=\"gh-prose\"><ul class=\"gh-list\"><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">floor-to-ceiling windows</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">vintage stained glass</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">original Carrara marble floor</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">three 19th-century fireplaces</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">167 restored illuminated ceiling embellishments</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id=\"capacity\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"capacity-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Capacity, in the venue’s own figures\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"capacity-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Capacity, in the venue’s own figures</span></h2></div><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Every room on these pages is one the venue offers for weddings.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeh